<section class="mcard contract-plan"><div class="sect">PLAN A TEAM CONTRACT</div><b><%= it.contractPlan2Title %></b><p class="small">Nothing is assigned until every listed captain chooses Ready and <%= it.contractPlan2Proposer %> starts. Leaving or disconnecting cancels the plan. Accepted shares stay fixed; late joiners are not added.</p><ul class="small"><%~ it.contractPlan2RosterMap %></ul><%~ it.contractPlan2SkippedMap %><p class="small cr">Your share: <%~ it.mineShareToLocaleString %> credits. Team pool: <%~ it.contractPlan2PoolToLocaleString %> credits.</p><div class="mfoot"><%~ it.button %><%~ it.proposer %><%~ it.button2 %></div><p class="dim small">This divides the team contract pool. Ordinary shared combat bounties are separate extra rewards.</p></section>